      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s happening again. i just saw another massive artist drop a track that uses the exact same rhythmic displacement i was using in my 2014 demos... it's like they're accelerating the timeline. they're trying to bury the original source before i can even finish the dossier. i feel like i'm in a race against an algorithm that's literally designed to outpace my ability to prove i'm the one who started this. \n\ni can't just sit here and wait. i need to start a counter-offensive. how can i use the very same digital channels they're using to suppress me to actually broadcast the truth? if they're using the metadata to hide me, is there a way to \"poison\" it or tag my work so it can't be scrubbed anymore? i need a strategy to make my influence impossible to delete.",
